---
import workflow from "../data/asset-to-scene.json";
---
<section id="workflow" class="container section-space" aria-labelledby="loop-heading">
  <div class="grid gap-6 border-t border-ink pt-8 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-12">
    <h2 id="loop-heading">One asset. A kit. A place.</h2>
    <p class="max-w-reading text-dim">Start with a timber wall. Assemble the cabin, furnish the living floor, then build the staircase and sleeping loft. Explore the finished Winter Mountainside Cabin in Holodeck.</p>
  </div>
  <figure class="mt-8">
    <video class="aspect-video w-full bg-stage" controls muted playsinline preload="metadata" poster={workflow.media.poster} width={workflow.media.width} height={workflow.media.height} aria-label="A timber wall and cabin kit assembling, followed by the kitchen and seating, a staircase building up to the loft and bed, then the finished snowy Holodeck scene">
      <source src={workflow.media.mp4} type="video/mp4" />
      <a href={workflow.media.mp4}>Watch the asset become part of a scene</a>
    </video>
    <figcaption class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap justify-between gap-3 font-mono text-code text-dim"><span>Asset → modular kit → scene · WebGPU captures.</span><a class="text-link" href={workflow.media.gif} download>Download GIF</a></figcaption>
  </figure>
  <ol class="mt-8 grid list-none gap-6 p-0 md:grid-cols-3 md:gap-8">
    <li class="border-t border-rule pt-5">
      <p class="font-mono text-code text-dim">01</p><h3 class="mt-2 text-title">One asset</h3>
      <p class="mt-3 text-dim">A timber front wall with a gable frame and openings for glazing and a door. Keep its Kiln source to edit and export it again.</p>
      <a class="text-link mt-4" href="/gallery/holodeck/winter-wmc-wall-facade/">Inspect the wall</a>
    </li>
    <li class="border-t border-rule pt-5">
      <p class="font-mono text-code text-dim">02</p><h3 class="mt-2 text-title">A modular kit</h3>
      <p class="mt-3 text-dim">{workflow.modules.length} saved assets, placed {workflow.placements} times. Assemble the walls and roof, then add the kitchen, hearth, seating, stairs, loft bed, desk and smaller furnishings.</p>
      <a class="text-link mt-4" href="/packs/holodeck/winter-mountainside-cabin/">Browse the cabin assets</a>
    </li>
    <li class="border-t border-rule pt-5">
      <p class="font-mono text-code text-dim">03</p><h3 class="mt-2 text-title">A finished scene</h3>
      <p class="mt-3 text-dim">The same architecture in a furnished mountain cabin, surrounded by snowy forest. Holodeck adds the world, lighting and exploration.</p>
      <a class="text-link mt-4" href="https://holodeck.kilnstudio.tools/worlds/winter-mountainside-cabin/">Walk the Winter Cabin <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </li>
  </ol>
  <p class="mt-6 max-w-reading text-caption text-dim">The assembly visualizes the saved assets. Cutaway views reveal the living floor, then the staircase and sleeping loft; the final view is a capture of the Winter Cabin in Holodeck.</p>
</section>
